      "rkaf:assertsPredicate": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:logic_text",
      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "(4) Before admitting the first visitor, the organizer must give the agency either a signed paper inspection record or an electronic inspection record signed by the inspecting officer. Each record must identify the display, the inspection date, and every public exit inspected.",
